WEBVTT

00:08.120 --> 00:09.860
N-No!

00:17.260 --> 00:19.660
R-Ring King!

00:19.660 --> 00:20.840
Get out of here, fast!

00:20.840 --> 00:22.250
Y-Yes!

00:22.900 --> 00:24.510
That was the third one.

00:24.510 --> 00:27.160
I passed out after just 
one swing before, but now...

00:27.160 --> 00:31.710
That's because of the kiss 
you just shared with the princess.

00:32.030 --> 00:34.460
The strength of your bond as husband and wife

00:34.460 --> 00:37.430
translates directly to power from that ring!

00:37.430 --> 00:42.840
It's a princess's duty to provide strength 
to a king heading into battle.

00:43.460 --> 00:45.080
<i>So that's why Hime...</i>

00:47.560 --> 00:51.580
Well, you still won't last 
very long right now, Satou-kun.

00:51.580 --> 00:52.560
But don't worry!

00:52.560 --> 00:54.830
I'm with you, as well!

00:54.830 --> 00:58.560
That reminds me. 
Are you really strong or something?

00:58.560 --> 01:01.760
I heard them calling you 
Sage Asparagus or something?

01:01.760 --> 01:03.330
Alabaster!

01:06.050 --> 01:07.050
What?

01:09.010 --> 01:11.380
<i>He's different from the ones before?</i>

01:12.500 --> 01:14.630
The Ring of Light...

01:15.200 --> 01:16.540
The Ring King!

01:17.890 --> 01:19.450
That figure!

01:19.450 --> 01:20.750
I-Impossible!

01:20.750 --> 01:23.180
A Knight of the Abyss King?!

01:23.810 --> 01:26.040
<i>Hime gave me this power!</i>

01:26.040 --> 01:27.480
I can still keep going!

01:27.480 --> 01:28.560
Don't!

01:31.920 --> 01:34.230
Wh-What is this wind?!

01:38.070 --> 01:40.270
That hurt quite a bit...

01:40.270 --> 01:43.740
But I guess it's thanks to the ring 
that I was only harmed this much?

01:43.740 --> 01:45.370
Satou-kun, we're running!

01:45.370 --> 01:46.040
Huh?!

01:46.040 --> 01:47.400
Listen, just hurry!

01:47.400 --> 01:49.000
What's going on?!

01:58.220 --> 02:01.180
I can't believe they sent 
something that strong.

02:01.180 --> 02:05.180
I suppose that just shows how 
much they fear the Ring King.

02:05.730 --> 02:07.000
What was that thing?

02:07.000 --> 02:09.060
I couldn't even get close to it.

02:10.470 --> 02:12.540
That was a knight of the Abyss King!

02:12.540 --> 02:15.940
It's a terrifying monster capable 
of wielding powerful magic!

02:15.940 --> 02:16.960
Magic?!

02:16.960 --> 02:19.490
I thought I was supposed to be able to 
handle them using the power of the ring?!

02:19.490 --> 02:21.100
We can talk about that later!

02:21.100 --> 02:22.780
I'll buy us some time!

02:28.410 --> 02:30.320
W-Wow!

02:30.320 --> 02:31.630
What is this?!

02:32.210 --> 02:35.530
I manipulated the elements 
of creation using my will

02:35.530 --> 02:38.010
in accordance with the laws of this world.

02:38.010 --> 02:40.090
That was also magic.

02:40.090 --> 02:42.380
Now, once we make it through there...

02:43.080 --> 02:44.070
Grandpa!

02:48.960 --> 02:50.410
Oh, no!

02:50.410 --> 02:52.150
They've pincered us!

02:57.190 --> 02:59.590
Huh? Prince?!

03:01.400 --> 03:02.200
Hurry!

03:02.200 --> 03:03.740
There's a carriage over there!

03:03.740 --> 03:04.890
Hold on!

03:04.890 --> 03:07.000
We're fleeing from the castle?!

03:07.000 --> 03:08.330
But Hime is still inside!

03:08.330 --> 03:10.160
Don't worry about that!

03:10.160 --> 03:12.000
Just come this way, now!

03:19.480 --> 03:21.680
Thank goodness you're safe.

03:22.290 --> 03:23.460
Hime...

03:26.850 --> 03:31.230
We still let the monsters 
reach the south tower in the end...

03:31.580 --> 03:36.610
I was forced to bring the princess 
to safety before danger could reach her.

03:36.890 --> 03:39.830
Thanks for rescuing us earlier.

03:40.370 --> 03:41.490
Uh...

03:42.230 --> 03:45.700
My name is Marmarugias Gisaras.

03:45.700 --> 03:48.380
I'm the second prince of the Gisaras Empire,

03:48.380 --> 03:50.700
neighbor of the Kingdom of Light, Nokanatika.

03:50.700 --> 03:54.810
Ma? Mar? Margarita-san?

03:54.810 --> 03:56.460
Thank you very much.

03:58.260 --> 04:00.300
You can just call me Marse.

04:01.670 --> 04:06.180
More importantly, Sage, 
will the Kingdom be all right?

04:06.760 --> 04:12.670
The Abyss King is currently 
after the rings and the Ring King himself.

04:12.670 --> 04:16.190
Once he learns they're not in the castle, 
he should commence a search.

04:16.190 --> 04:18.830
I doubt the Kingdom will suffer further harm.

04:18.830 --> 04:19.780
However...

04:20.630 --> 04:24.400
It will prove difficult to eliminate 
high-ranking monsters

04:24.400 --> 04:27.660
like the Abyss King's knights 
without the power of light.

04:28.050 --> 04:31.520
So that means I really do have to be 
the one to do something about them!

04:31.520 --> 04:35.210
And we're running away because you don't 
have enough power to do that, Satou-kun.

04:35.610 --> 04:38.140
What do you mean,
 I don't have enough power?

04:38.140 --> 04:44.470
Well, your power as the Ring King 
is still but a small amount.

04:44.810 --> 04:47.930
In order to bring out your full power,

04:47.930 --> 04:51.430
you'll need the other four rings.

04:51.880 --> 04:54.400
Other four?

04:54.400 --> 04:56.480
But this is a wedding ring, right?!

04:58.650 --> 05:00.300
So you mean...

05:00.300 --> 05:01.340
Yes.

05:01.340 --> 05:03.280
Satou-kun, you will have to

05:03.280 --> 05:09.900
marry four other princesses 
and obtain the rings from them!

05:10.990 --> 05:11.950
What?!

05:11.950 --> 05:14.270
That would be polygamy, though!

05:14.270 --> 05:16.780
That's what it means to be the Ring King.

05:16.780 --> 05:18.250
There's no problem there.

05:18.540 --> 05:21.590
Well? Kind of exciting, isn't it?

05:21.590 --> 05:24.240
Hmm? That's five princesses, you know.

05:23.950 --> 05:25.770
Well, I-I guess?

05:24.240 --> 05:26.200
You'll be living every man's dream!

05:26.200 --> 05:27.760
No, I have Hime!

05:27.760 --> 05:31.560
<i>It doesn't excite me at all.</i>

07:03.330 --> 07:05.900
There're only two rooms available?

07:06.320 --> 07:08.880
Then us three men will share a room.

07:08.880 --> 07:10.000
No.

07:10.000 --> 07:13.130
It might be dangerous to leave Krystal alone!

07:13.130 --> 07:15.550
I'll have to share her room.

07:15.550 --> 07:16.790
Huh? No way.

07:19.070 --> 07:23.080
That means you, her husband, 
will have to share her room.

07:28.230 --> 07:31.760
Now then, before we start 
taking action tomorrow,

07:31.760 --> 07:34.500
let's go over a few simple things.

07:35.100 --> 07:39.220
Like the true duty of the Ring King.

07:40.960 --> 07:43.000
Long ago,

07:43.000 --> 07:48.020
this world was on the verge of succumbing 
to the dark powers of the Abyss.

07:48.530 --> 07:52.920
The hearts of mankind were nearly 
broken from the endless assault of evil,

07:52.920 --> 07:57.740
and many nations were covered 
by the shadow of death and lost.

07:58.310 --> 08:01.100
The Ring King sought to dispel that darkness,

08:01.100 --> 08:04.330
and so he forged rings imbued with magic.

08:04.330 --> 08:12.620
The five rings were the rings of Light, 
Fire, Water, Wind, and Earth.

08:13.040 --> 08:17.450
With their power, the Ring King 
fought a long and grueling battle,

08:17.450 --> 08:20.310
ultimately defeating and 
sealing away the Abyss King.

08:20.310 --> 08:26.680
Afterwards, the five princesses 
married to the Ring King

08:26.680 --> 08:32.320
passed the five rings down through 
the generations within their five nations.

08:32.320 --> 08:35.180
That set of five rings 
served as proof of the bond

08:35.180 --> 08:37.950
between the Ring King and those princesses.

08:38.610 --> 08:45.420
And now, the Abyss King has revived 
and is slowly regaining his power.

08:45.420 --> 08:47.770
The duty of the Ring King

08:47.770 --> 08:51.600
is to once again obtain the rings 
from each of the five princesses,

08:51.600 --> 08:55.880
and use their power to seal the Abyss.

08:56.310 --> 08:59.750
So that's the duty of the Ring King.

09:02.690 --> 09:04.600
About what he said earlier...

09:05.220 --> 09:07.320
You don't need to worry about it.

09:07.320 --> 09:10.330
Marriage... is just a formality anyways.

09:10.330 --> 09:11.780
No, I...!

09:12.190 --> 09:13.840
Satou?

09:13.840 --> 09:16.030
Maybe it's a bruise?

09:16.030 --> 09:18.340
I thought it was nothing.

09:18.340 --> 09:19.240
Strip!

09:19.240 --> 09:21.790
Huh?! That's awfully bold all of sudden!

09:21.790 --> 09:24.060
Quit fooling around at a time like this!

09:28.050 --> 09:30.810
It's my fault.

09:32.420 --> 09:35.690
No, this is because I got carried away.

09:35.690 --> 09:37.090
No!

09:37.880 --> 09:40.380
It's because I chose you.

09:42.780 --> 09:43.770
Hime?!

09:50.210 --> 09:51.230
Hime!

09:53.400 --> 09:54.940
Where did she go?

09:58.530 --> 10:00.440
Marse.

10:01.880 --> 10:03.120
What's the matter?

10:03.390 --> 10:05.530
Have you seen Hime?

10:05.530 --> 10:08.920
Princess Krystal just passed through here.

10:08.920 --> 10:09.820
Huh?!

10:11.170 --> 10:12.390
I see.

10:13.160 --> 10:15.660
The Ring King and the Ring Princess.

10:16.120 --> 10:20.120
It's a heavy responsibility, and that duty 
can become too much to bear sometimes.

10:20.120 --> 10:22.570
No! It's nothing that bad!

10:23.860 --> 10:25.250
You know...

10:25.250 --> 10:27.180
I'm grateful to you.

10:30.290 --> 10:31.920
To be honest,

10:31.920 --> 10:35.980
I'm relieved that I've avoided 
the duty of the Ring King.

10:37.720 --> 10:41.570
You chased that woman here 
from another world, right?

10:42.770 --> 10:44.460
She must be precious to you.

10:44.460 --> 10:47.450
Well, I just...

10:51.380 --> 10:55.900
You threw away the world you knew 
just to pursue the woman you love.

10:56.960 --> 10:58.970
That's no easy task.

10:59.450 --> 11:00.780
You can take pride in it.

11:03.840 --> 11:06.380
Sorry for delaying you.

11:07.080 --> 11:09.290
She's probably in the rear garden up ahead.

11:09.290 --> 11:10.760
Oh, right!

11:14.520 --> 11:16.170
Thanks a lot!

11:19.620 --> 11:23.370
If only I had his courage, as well.

11:31.190 --> 11:32.550
Satou?

11:35.280 --> 11:36.410
I...

11:39.830 --> 11:42.380
I love you, Hime!

11:45.400 --> 11:47.160
Not just as a friend.

11:48.450 --> 11:50.840
I really love you.

11:52.730 --> 11:55.740
I'm here because I want to be here.

11:56.400 --> 11:58.300
It's what I've decided.

11:58.300 --> 12:01.770
So you don't have to feel responsible for it.

12:03.970 --> 12:06.860
You have resolve, don't you?

12:08.120 --> 12:11.420
I'm still struggling with it...

12:12.680 --> 12:16.240
I tried to forget my time as Himeno Nonaka

12:16.240 --> 12:19.930
and fulfill my duty 
as the maiden of the Ring of Light.

12:21.280 --> 12:25.530
I was even about to marry someone 
I never knew for the sake of this world,

12:25.530 --> 12:27.540
and I would've endured much worse...

12:29.860 --> 12:32.500
But because you chased after me...

12:33.040 --> 12:35.830
all of my resolve vanished.

12:37.010 --> 12:42.060
After all, that meant I could actually 
marry the man I really love.

12:45.000 --> 12:48.030
But my husband will become the Ring King.

12:48.630 --> 12:53.030
He will fight, get hurt, 
and even marry other Princesses, too.

12:54.360 --> 12:59.050
And I don't want to see 
the man I love do those things.

13:01.250 --> 13:02.260
Hime...

13:02.850 --> 13:04.050
I'm sorry.

13:04.050 --> 13:06.980
I was only thinking of myself.

13:07.670 --> 13:09.780
No, that's not it.

13:11.960 --> 13:14.430
I'm going to drop the act!

13:14.940 --> 13:17.270
This time, I'll steel my resolve.

13:18.070 --> 13:19.670
It won't just be a formality.

13:20.310 --> 13:25.240
I'll fulfill my duty to you 
and the ring as your real wife!

13:25.830 --> 13:27.050
Hime...

13:28.100 --> 13:29.290
Satou...

13:31.200 --> 13:35.800
Will you take me as your bride once more?

13:38.080 --> 13:39.060
Yeah.

13:46.580 --> 13:48.420
<i>What now?!</i>

13:49.070 --> 13:52.060
<i>After saying all that...</i>

13:52.630 --> 13:56.220
<i>It feels like we've built up the mood for that!</i>

13:56.850 --> 13:57.680
Satou!

13:57.680 --> 13:58.440
Ah!

13:58.440 --> 14:03.780
I'm, um... I'm prepared 
to become your wife, so—

14:20.130 --> 14:23.160
<i>Is it really okay to just do it?!</i>

14:23.160 --> 14:25.180
<i>I know I wanted this, but...</i>

14:25.590 --> 14:27.740
<i>but this isn't...</i>

14:36.870 --> 14:39.820
Satou? What's the matter?

14:40.880 --> 14:42.020
It's wrong.

14:43.600 --> 14:45.190
It's not supposed to be like this.

14:45.190 --> 14:46.200
Huh?

14:47.720 --> 14:51.950
Our first time together is supposed 
to be sweeter than this!

14:51.950 --> 14:52.950
Huh?!

14:53.280 --> 14:57.000
Just going with the flow like this is wrong!

14:57.000 --> 15:02.300
There's no way it's okay for the ten years 
I spent pining for you to end like that!

15:02.300 --> 15:04.090
What? That's creepy.

15:05.680 --> 15:07.170
Anyway!

15:07.680 --> 15:10.040
This isn't like us at all.

15:11.190 --> 15:14.390
We've gone beyond childhood 
friends to being married.

15:14.390 --> 15:18.100
So let's take our time 
enjoying the things couples do.

15:19.510 --> 15:22.310
Yeah. You're right.

15:32.130 --> 15:35.580
How was it? Did you sleep well last night?

15:35.580 --> 15:38.120
Yeah! Just great!

15:38.680 --> 15:40.710
<i>I couldn't sleep at all!</i>

15:42.800 --> 15:46.680
What, you two haven't 
done anything since then?

15:46.680 --> 15:49.320
After you got all worked up, too!

15:49.320 --> 15:50.720
How boring!

15:50.720 --> 15:52.090
You were watching?!

15:52.090 --> 15:54.060
Whoops, slip of the tongue.

15:54.060 --> 15:58.970
Bonds. Those are what grant 
the Ring King his power, remember.

16:02.770 --> 16:06.520
So it's a good thing for you two 
to deepen your bond.

16:08.960 --> 16:09.850
Good morning.

16:09.850 --> 16:13.300
Looks like you two resolved your problem.

16:13.880 --> 16:15.420
Now, take these.

16:16.980 --> 16:20.200
Those outfits from the other world 
stand out a bit too much after all.

16:22.870 --> 16:24.790
Now, let's be off.

16:24.790 --> 16:29.850
First, we head to the hidden village 
of the elves, the children of knowledge.

16:29.850 --> 16:31.670
To Wind's Romca.

16:31.670 --> 16:35.640
Elves? You mean the ones 
with long ears? Those elves?

16:35.640 --> 16:36.930
I do.

16:36.930 --> 16:41.020
The Ring of Wind is passed down 
among their royal family.

16:41.020 --> 16:42.140
And also...

16:42.140 --> 16:45.850
Elves are a truly beautiful race!

16:45.850 --> 16:50.080
That immediately gets you 
motivated, right, Satou-kun?!

16:50.080 --> 16:50.890
Well...

16:50.890 --> 16:52.490
Stop it, Grandpa!

16:52.780 --> 16:55.070
I'm your real wife, got it?!

16:55.070 --> 16:56.570
Yeah! I know!

16:56.570 --> 16:58.220
Do you really get it?

16:58.220 --> 16:59.440
Yeah! No worries!

16:59.440 --> 17:01.940
Jeez, are you really sure?

17:04.430 --> 17:06.460
The Ring King...

17:07.090 --> 17:09.110
A man from the outside...

17:09.570 --> 17:12.600
How disgusting!

17:16.870 --> 17:22.200
<i>Nestled in a deep valley lies the land 
where beautiful and wise elves live.</i>

17:22.740 --> 17:24.330
<i>This land was once viewed</i>

17:24.330 --> 17:28.680
<i>as a sacred place where knowledge 
from throughout the world was gathered.</i>

17:29.200 --> 17:30.940
<i>However, 50 years ago,</i>

17:30.940 --> 17:35.590
<i>Romca was suddenly 
surrounded by a wall of storms.</i>

17:42.090 --> 17:46.670
This is the tempest wall 
that blocks the entry of other races?

17:46.670 --> 17:49.920
This nation has changed an awful lot, too.

17:50.320 --> 17:53.360
Grandpa, have you been here before?

17:53.360 --> 17:54.760
Long ago.

17:54.760 --> 17:59.290
However, there was no wall 
when I last came here.

18:06.930 --> 18:08.540
What is that?

18:08.540 --> 18:11.080
Is that one of the Abyss King's monsters, too?!

18:12.320 --> 18:15.260
No, that's just a beast of the forest.

18:15.260 --> 18:17.360
It's like a bear.

18:17.640 --> 18:19.930
Oh, just a bear!

18:19.930 --> 18:21.870
So it's just a wild animal.

18:21.870 --> 18:24.010
Meaning it's not dangerous.

18:24.850 --> 18:26.320
You fool!

18:26.320 --> 18:30.030
Who in their right mind approaches 
a wild animal without caution!

18:30.030 --> 18:32.600
Bears in the forest are plenty dangerous!

18:32.600 --> 18:34.210
I'm sorry!

18:35.260 --> 18:36.380
Shit!

18:36.380 --> 18:37.800
Now we can't run!

18:40.720 --> 18:42.260
Hurry, this way!

18:47.480 --> 18:49.770
The bear went flying.

18:51.620 --> 18:53.640
Who are you people?

18:53.640 --> 18:55.900
What are humans doing out here?

18:57.110 --> 18:58.760
<i>Their ears are long...</i>

18:59.280 --> 19:00.710
which means...!

19:01.110 --> 19:05.450
Children of the wind, you have 
my gratitude for saving us.

19:05.450 --> 19:06.490
We are...

19:07.070 --> 19:08.960
I'm the Ring King!

19:08.960 --> 19:10.920
I've come to meet your princess!

19:12.710 --> 19:14.620
Hey! Satou!

19:14.620 --> 19:18.460
The ring nations aren't guaranteed 
to be cooperative, you know!

19:18.460 --> 19:20.470
Urk, really?!

19:20.910 --> 19:23.500
The Ring King. I see.

19:23.950 --> 19:26.430
I had heard the rumors...

19:27.240 --> 19:28.320
All right.

19:28.320 --> 19:30.010
We'll lead you to the palace.

19:30.010 --> 19:33.020
I don't think it's going to work 
out for you, though.

19:36.610 --> 19:40.250
You'll need to pass through the roots 
of this giant tree to reach Romca.

19:40.610 --> 19:43.340
That's... inconvenient.

19:43.340 --> 19:44.950
It's for safety.

19:44.950 --> 19:49.420
Small creatures able to pass through 
here won't cause much harm,

19:49.420 --> 19:52.410
and powerful monsters 
are driven away by the wind.

19:52.410 --> 19:54.040
It's reassuring.

20:01.880 --> 20:06.440
So this is Romca, the Ring of Wind's nation?

20:14.820 --> 20:17.150
I wonder what she's like,

20:17.150 --> 20:19.150
this elf princess.

20:19.150 --> 20:21.400
It'll be fine, no matter who it is.

20:22.800 --> 20:25.270
I'll accept the ring to save this world.

20:25.670 --> 20:27.450
Nothing else will happen.

20:39.330 --> 20:40.300
Huh?

20:40.300 --> 20:41.950
No one's here?

20:41.950 --> 20:42.630
Ah!

20:42.630 --> 20:44.220
Behind the throne!

20:46.590 --> 20:48.780
That's the princess?

20:48.780 --> 20:51.790
She looks really wary of me!

20:51.790 --> 20:53.560
Y-Yeah...

20:54.530 --> 20:59.360
So you're... the Ring King?

20:59.360 --> 21:00.170
Yes!

21:00.170 --> 21:03.280
I'm Satou, the hero from another world!

21:03.280 --> 21:04.740
Another world?!

21:04.740 --> 21:06.040
That's right!

21:09.140 --> 21:13.050
And the two of you... are married, right?

21:14.070 --> 21:16.980
Meaning that...

21:18.040 --> 21:19.710
you've already done it?

21:19.710 --> 21:20.630
Huh?

21:21.080 --> 21:25.760
You know, m-m-m-ma—

21:26.470 --> 21:28.680
<i>What is this girl asking us?!</i>

21:29.000 --> 21:29.640
Ma—

21:29.640 --> 21:30.860
Not yet!

21:30.860 --> 21:32.560
You haven't made out?!

21:32.560 --> 21:33.560
That's what you meant?!

21:34.050 --> 21:36.810
Uh, yeah, we have.

21:37.940 --> 21:41.220
<i>This isn't good. We can't be 
getting flustered over this.</i>

21:41.650 --> 21:45.200
The Ring of Light is already on his hand.

21:45.200 --> 21:47.740
We seek the Ring of Wind, according to legend,

21:47.740 --> 21:49.990
so we may drive away 
the threat of the Abyss King—

21:49.990 --> 21:52.120
H-How dirty!

21:52.120 --> 21:54.620
Touching your lips to another's!

21:54.620 --> 21:56.080
Huh?!

21:56.080 --> 21:57.920
That's gross!

21:57.920 --> 21:59.330
She fled!

